# Append-only event/fact streams: two sessions appending different lines
# at EOF must auto-merge, not conflict. This is what makes gasp_shim.sh's
# pull-rebase retry actually work for concurrent gasp pushes (evolve vs
# social racing on state/events.jsonl — see yoyo-evolve Day 160 post-mortem).
# Whole-file mirrors (DREAM.md, DAY_COUNT, memory/active_*.md) are left to
# default merge deliberately: union would interleave two full copies.
*.jsonl merge=union
